1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
A perfect AI clone of my voice just
asked my bank for ₹45,000.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Same voice. Different phone.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
The bank's AI asks the real me,
on my own phone.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
I said no. It got nothing.
The bank never even saw the request.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Harder: it's really me —
but a scammer is coaching me.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
A step-up would fail (I'd approve it).
So it goes to a human.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Me, asking normally? Instant.

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
My AI assistant gets a Halyn Pass:
exactly what I allowed. Nothing more.

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The voice agent can only propose.
Halyn decides. Only Halyn executes.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Don't trust the voice. Trust the permission.
halyn-voice.vercel.app
